% Regression guard for beat_modifier() in store.c, which applies the -BF 2
% (Barfly) stress model one bar at a time by scanning the features of the
% bar up to its closing bar line.
% - The tune ends with a bar line, after which there is none: the scan used
%   to run past the end of feature[] (heap-buffer-overflow under the
%   sanitize build).
% - Bar 2 is split across two lines.  Stopping the scan at the end of a
%   line of music (MUSICSTOP) left B A G, after the line break, unstressed;
%   the golden pins the stressed durations and velocities of all six notes.
X:1
T:Barfly bar split across lines
C:abc2midi test
M:6/8
L:1/8
R:jig
K:ADor
EAA A2B|cBA
BAG|EAA A2B|
